OL,3,GNEWSAClarity sought over UK-based
OL,4,AStates director
OL,5,
OL,6,FA politician has raised concerns over
OL,7,Fhow a senior civil servant was allowed
OL,8,Fto work for the States of Guernsey
OL,9,Fdespite not living on the island.
OL,11,FGary Salter, who was the director of
OL,12,Fpopulation management, has since left
OL,13,Fhis role after he was criticised for
OL,14,Fbeing based in the UK.
OL,16,FDeputy Rob Curgenven submitted
OL,17,Fquestions under the States rule 14
OL,18,Fprocedure asking whether the Committee
OL,19,Ffor Home Affairs knew where Salter
OL,20,Flived and sought future assurances over
OL,21,Fwhere senior posts are based.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Ch Is NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,443,440,260,160,0,100
