OL,3,GNEWSAClarity sought over UK-based
OL,4,AStates director
OL,5,
OL,6,FCommittee President Marc Leadbeater
OL,7,Fsaid he did not yet have the full
OL,8,Fdetails of how long Salter had lived
OL,9,Foff island but he believed it had been
OL,10,Fa "considerable amount of time".
